^[^ ]+ (?!.*(READFAIL|read failed)).*\(clear\)$
^[^ ]+ balance: BALANCE READFAIL .*\((start|clear)\)$
^[^ ]+ workers: WORKER WAITING (?!.* ESCALATE ).*\(start\)$
^[^ ]+ audit: (AUDIT BASELINE|RED|THREADS|COPILOT|CONFLICT|CHANGES|NOREVIEWER|APPROVED[A-Z-]*|LEGACY|TRUNCATED|NOCHECKS) .*\(start\)$
^[^ ]+ watchers: Watcher digest, .*\(digest\)$
